### Update product
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/product/update/69d76d1f95faf7930ed956f0
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

{
    "product_type": "Clothing",
   "product_attributes": {
