### Get all drafts for shop
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/drafts
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: {{accessToken}}


### Get all published products for shop
GET {{baseUrl}}/product/published
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

### Publish product
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/product/publish/69d76d1f95faf7930ed956f0
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-client-id: {{userId}}
Authorization: {{accessToken}}

### Unpublish product
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/product/unpublish/69d76d1f95faf7930ed956f0
Content-Type: application/json
